OL,3,GNEWSAAgreement secures future of
OL,4,Acounty's music service
OL,5,
OL,6,FAn agreement has been reached to save
OL,7,Fservices provided by a music and drama
OL,8,Flibrary which will close on 31
OL,9,FDecember.
OL,11,FThe Performing Arts Library, in Welwyn
OL,12,FGarden City, lends orchestral and
OL,13,Fchoral scores as well as play scripts,
OL,14,Fand provides material written for
OL,15,Fschools.
OL,17,FUnder the new agreement, its collection
OL,18,Fwill be transferred to the charity
OL,19,FBenslow Music when the service is
OL,20,Fclosed by Hertfordshire County Council,
OL,21,Fsaving the local authority #230,000.
OL,23,APub: 27-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB E Eng NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
